#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "68_Sodachi"
msgid "Even though we've churned out three champions already, we're still not getting any more apprentices. I don't understand..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "80_Saejima"
msgid "You're right. New applicants should be bangin' on the door by now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "92_Sodachi"
msgid "Exactly! But I don't hear any banging... *gasp* Maybe it's because of how scary you look. I think you might be creeping people out..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "104_Sodachi"
msgid "Ugh... I'm so depressed."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "116_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "128_Sugiyama"
msgid "Saejima-san! Sodachi-san! Come quick!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "140_Sodachi"
msgid "What? What happened? Did you find some money on the ground again or something? You can be so pathetic sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "152_Sugiyama"
msgid "No! New apprentices! New apprentices are here! And lots of them!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "164_Sodachi"
msgid "What...? Oh, that. Apprentices. Right..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Sodachi"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "200_Sodachi"
msgid "Whaaaaaaaat!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "212_Sugiyama"
msgid "Look! Three new apprentices!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "224_New Apprentice"
msgid "I'm Koike, nice to meet you. I wanna sweat to the max and lose some of this weight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "236_New Apprentice"
msgid "I'm Makoto Tokita. I want to be a pro fighter."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "248_Tokita"
msgid "I used to train at a different dojo, but it wasn't really the best place for me. So I've been looking for a new place to train."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "260_Tokita"
msgid "We may not have seen eye to eye on things, but I wasn't kicked out－I left by choice. That's the truth!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "272_Tokita"
msgid "Well, I heard that this dojo has been producing some champions and thought that it'd be perfect for someone of such tremendous skill as myself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "284_Tokita"
msgid "I wouldn't mind becoming an apprentice here, if you really want me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "296_New Apprentice"
msgid "Nice to meet you, I'm Toyama. I want to join because I want to get back into shape."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "308_Sodachi"
msgid "Wow! Three at once! This is going to skyrocket my monthly earnings! Heheheh..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "320_Sugiyama"
msgid "But what are you going to do? It's going to be hard for Saejima-san to train three people at once."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "332_Sodachi"
msgid "You've got a point... Saejima-san, please choose one of these three to train."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "344_Saejima"
msgid "Hmm. Lemme see..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "392_Saejima"
msgid "Koike-kun, then."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "404_Tokita"
msgid "W-W-Wait...! Wait just a second!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Saejima"
msgid "What."
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "428_Tokita"
msgid "Koike-kun's never going to work! Didn't you hear him? He's only here to lose weight!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "440_Tokita"
msgid "There's no point in training someone unless they're aiming to go pro!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "452_Saejima"
msgid "Stop blabberin' already. Fine."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "464_Saejima"
msgid "Then..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "512_Saejima"
msgid "You, Toyama-kun."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "524_Tokita"
msgid "Wait...! Wait just a second!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "536_Saejima"
msgid "What."
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "548_Tokita"
msgid "Are you sure you didn't mean to choose me? I have experience fighting! I think that I'll be easy to train."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "560_Tokita"
msgid "But... I'm not asking you to pick me or anything."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "572_Tokita"
msgid "I'm just saying that I wouldn't mind training with you, if you insisted..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "584_Sodachi"
msgid "Looks like he really wants you to train him, Saejima-san. Give him a shot."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "596_Sodachi"
msgid "To be honest, he seems like a lot of work, so I don't want anything to do with him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "608_Saejima"
msgid "Since when did ya become so frank?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "692_Sodachi"
msgid "Well, he's yours now! Hide-chan and I will look after the other two."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "704_Tokita"
msgid "So, you're going to train me? I trust that you feel honored by this noble opportunity."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "716_Sodachi"
msgid "Let's go ahead and get started!"
msgstr ""

